	(text "-=GM65 Pinout (From Documentation)=-\nPIN	Input/Output	Definition 		Remark\n1 	－				NC 				/\n2 	Power 			VCC 			DC3.3V\n3	GND 			GND\n4	IN 				UART RX\n5	OUT 			UART TX\n6	IN 				USB D- \n7 	OUT 			USB D+\n8	NC\n9	OUT 			BEEPER 			Connected to passive buzzer\n10	OUT 			DLED 			Indicator for decoding successfully\n11	－ 				NC\n12	IN 				TRIG 			Low level triggers decoding"
